DESCRIPTION:Free After-Parade Open Skate & Santa Visits\nFriday\, November
  27 | 12:00 to 2:00 PM\nAt LECOM Event Center\nMake a day of it downtown! 
 After the 70th Annual Downtown Elmira Holiday Parade\, head to the LECOM E
 vent Center for a free open skate\, presented in partnership with LECOM an
 d Family Reading Partnership of Chemung Valley.\nSkating is free\, and ska
 tes are available to rent if needed.\nThe Family Reading Partnership will 
 be there handing out free books\, and Santa will be on hand for free visit
 s throughout the skate.\nThe parade steps off at 10:00 AM\, so you can cat
 ch it\, grab lunch downtown\, and then lace up. Bring the kids\, bring the
  grandparents\, bring a friend!!\nThe Downtown Elmira 70th Annual Holiday 
 Parade is sponsored by Community Bank\, N.A.\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - http
 s://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78520828/20261127120000
