DESCRIPTION:Event by Elmira Handmade Market and Chamberlain Acres Farmer
 ’s Market\nChamberlain Acres Garden Center & Florist\nDuration: 5 hr\nPu
 blic\nWE ARE BACK!!! Mark your calendars now... this year's Small Business
  Saturday Handmade Market will be from 10am - 3pm at Chamberlain Acres Gar
 den Center & Florist.\nFood will be available for purchase.\nThe Handmade 
 Markets are a series of one day seasonal shopping venues to connect the co
 mmunity with local makers and artists. The first pop up holiday market was
  held in December of 2015 in the Chamberlain Acres gift shop with 3 local 
 artists. At the time\, opportunities for fine artisans to showcase and sel
 l their work in Elmira were extremely rare. The tremendous support for tha
 t first pop up encouraged us to launch semi-annual handmade markets which 
 support around 20 local makers via a juried application. Elmira Handmade M
 arket events are run by makers for makers.\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https:
 //calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78518459/20261128100000
