BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Jackson Cavalier LIVE @ the LBC
DTSTART:20261211T220000Z
DTEND:20261212T010000Z
DTSTAMP:20261126T185810Z
UID:1421b1cd4f1b2e3e57f2b37e96e15e4b733d181e@corning-events
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Beer,Music
DESCRIPTION:Event by Laurentide Beer Company\nLaurentide Beer Company\nDur
 ation: 3 hr\nPublic\nJackson Cavalier returns to the LBC performing LIVE o
 n Friday\, December 11th from 5-8pm!\nJackson Cavalier is a musician\, per
 former\, musician's rights advocate\, and music booker\, based out of upst
 ate New York. He has been known to perform as a one man band\, as well as 
 a front-man for his group The Big Dead Waltz. He has been active in the mu
 sic industry since 2013 as an Americana and Roots-Rock musician\, although
  his music is not strictly confined to those genres.\nJackson released his
  first album\, 'Barefooted and Still Breathing' with his band The Feverton
 es at the age of 19. Since then he has gone on to release two solo albums
 \, 2017's 'Half-Moon'\, and 2018's 'Spellbound'. His latest album\, 'Defen
 d Your Illusion'\, was released in February 2022 and is the first full len
 gth album w/ his backing band The Big Dead Waltz.\n​Outside of the confi
 nes of the studio\, Jackson has also done extensive work gigging on stages
  across New York State and beyond\, as well as being widely known as an ac
 complished busker (street performer). Since 2014 Jackson has played 100 to
  200 gigs a year on average\, and is extremely familiar with the ever-grow
 ing brewery circuit as well as the traditional music venue performance.\n
 ​Beyond being a full time musician\, Jackson independently owns and oper
 ates a booking agency by the name of Voidyear MGMT. Voidyear was establish
 ed in 2021 as a means to help new\, or already established\, artists conne
 ct with ethical venues that provide fair pay to musicians.\nAs always at t
 he LBC\, No Cover and No Reservations\, all seating is on a first come fir
 st serve basis\nCheers!\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly/
 o9b0uzpj/event/78515500/20261211170000
GEO:42.661823;-77.05512
LOCATION:Laurentide Beer Company\, 12 Maiden Lane\, Penn Yan\, New York\, 
 14527\, United States
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78515500/20261211170000
END:VEVENT
