DESCRIPTION:Event by South Hill Cider\n550 Sandbank Road\, Ithaca\, NY\nPu
 blic\nAt the heart of the Cielle Trio is Cielle\, a powerhouse biracial\, 
 bicultural vocalist\, songwriter\, and rhythm guitarist whose compelling l
 yrics weave relatable stories of love\, loss\, and the beautiful challenge
 s of being human. Backed by the dynamic rhythms of Curtis Kretz on drums a
 nd the driving bass lines of Joe Crum on bass\, Cielle brings her songs to
  life with a sound that is both musically rich and emotionally resonant. T
 heir charismatic performances connect with audiences on a deeply human lev
 el\, leaving listeners feeling energized\, inspired\, and reminded that th
 ey’re not alone. From intimate venues to lively stages throughout New Yo
 rk’s Finger Lakes region and beyond\, the full band\, Cielle On Solid Gr
 ound and the Cielle Trio are building momentum with their distinctive soun
 d\, authentic storytelling\, and undeniable chemistry. This is a trio you
 ’ll want to hear live!\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly
 /o9b0uzpj/event/78514740/20261211180000
